   1449 
   1450 !    this function computes the flow of a culvert that flows full and
   1451 !    has a submerged entrance and a tailwater height which is less
   1452 !    than its diameter
   1453 
   1454 REAL (R8) function type5(HEAD)    !(HEAD)
   1455       USE STRUCTURES; USE PIPE; USE GLOBAL
